Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.22,0:29:10.23,Amore,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}You there, within that powerful yet weak-willed heart of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.23,0:29:13.36,Amore,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.36,0:29:17.53,Amore,,0,0,0,,find yourself spurred by revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:22.78,Amore,,0,0,0,,You there, heed now the future assured by my unerring nobility
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.78,0:29:26.99,Amore,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:30.37,Amore,,0,0,0,,And leave the past behind
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.37,0:29:36.75,Amore,,0,0,0,,Unsuited to such things as ladylike apparel or lipstick
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.75,0:29:42.05,Amore,,0,0,0,,I am envied by god and mortal alike,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.05,0:29:45.64,Amore,,0,0,0,,for I am a Perfect Knight of Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.64,0:29:47.60,Amore,,0,0,0,,Pure Amore Love
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.60,0:29:51.14,Amore,,0,0,0,,Let it bloom ever magnificently
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.14,0:29:57.07,Amore,,0,0,0,,A casablanca bursting open like raging magma
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.07,0:29:58.65,Amore,,0,0,0,,Amore, come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.65,0:30:02.07,Amore,,0,0,0,,I shall tell you now the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.07,0:30:04.41,Amore,,0,0,0,,What is “love”?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.41,0:30:07.49,Amore,,0,0,0,,Love is merely a fantasy for fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.49,0:30:12.58,Amore,,0,0,0,,Yet it is by the whims of love
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.58,0:30:16.46,Amore,,0,0,0,,that we two have been drawn here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.92,0:30:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.88,0:30:20.34,Amore,,0,0,0,,Amore, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.34,0:30:23.59,Amore,,0,0,0,,Avert not your eyes from the flower;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.59,0:30:26.22,Amore,,0,0,0,,its hue rivaling any shade of crimson
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.22,0:30:29.18,Amore,,0,0,0,,This pristine frenzy is for you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.18,0:30:34.23,Amore,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it’s for the sake of love
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.23,0:30:38.02,Amore,,0,0,0,,and these dreams that “I” am here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Amore,,0,0,0,,
